# Boss design

Four phases.

The last one flies. See OPS-1.

- file: ../../files/<file notes.txt>/notes.txt

## Decision 1: Which explosion?

It is seen from far away.

1. Ring (recommended): one clean ring [file](../../files/<file ring.txt>/ring.txt)
2. Burst **(picked)**

Asked by @artist of @aram. Answer: with changes by @aram on <minute>: reads better small


## Decision 2: How many phases?

1. Three
2. Four

Asked by @artist of @aram


## Comments

**@aram**, <minute>

@bea no rings please.

**@artist**, <minute> (result)

